        <title>agents_for_guarantors</title>
        <link>https://resolutionbazaar.com/doku.php?id=personal_guarantors:agents_for_guarantors&amp;rev=1743928405&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Agents for Personal Guarantors to Corporate Debtors

PERSONAL GUARANTORS - Personal guarantors are individuals who have provided guarantees for debts owed by corporate debtors. Under IBC, they can be held liable for repayment in case of default, making them integral to recovering dues during insolvency processes.</description>
    </item>
